<km-doc>
<km-title nodeId="c7e4013eda29472e840346d7b8850025">说明：决策</km-title>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="6729da31401146078a100c300b2c6b44" />
<h1 nodeId="aa66ddbca14b4869b93e31d47f545ea1">一、背景</h1>
<p nodeId="8c452c682ec141b8b1fe80aa36699461">Zeus普通场景 或 分层场景-策略节点中部署策略时，需要对规则配置一个决策，决策在执行规则命中后会输出给调用方。</p>
<p nodeId="9922b53631ad48da944006d8bdc01a6f">对于Tatooine事件接入的流量，Zeus返回的决策会在Tatooine中统一翻译为风险等级（risklevel）向下游进行输出。<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1358367295" title="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1358367295" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="d25c02c0fdc04f2b8a672ec4e271abe6">https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1358367295</a></p>
<p nodeId="85e1fa118abb47aaac3d3b711edd5d5b">目前，Zeus决策根据特点和属性，被分为三个类型：普通决策、异步决策、组合决策。</p>
<h1 nodeId="72f8c37332664d7f85351dda1e378f5f">二、名词解释</h1>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="f4acb811470d425e9f36f2882531fb53">
<tr nodeId="47481f2ac0694680abd1597c957db5c1">
<th colwidth="[50]" nodeId="6acf8191d1f04c3bacadbc4108e2be82">
<p nodeId="7d583114add846878bf0c6d2b6afa4c9" />
</th>
<th colwidth="[131]" nodeId="985aa5dbd0124098af54fa124e003b45">
<p nodeId="a26fb3c4d20a4180bbd391e651123a3a">名词</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[1006]" nodeId="749db73decf14186b2e27f8f48ec613b">
<p nodeId="4ccdb5093f104908aaf10fef3db8c3df">解释</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="1e3c85dba5f2447aa1b61ff7b54b5362">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="1ce6f160c6b34350b74ef38f94428ebb">
<p nodeId="03f6c23632214a10af634286d2faeea3" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[131]" nodeId="0298a80378b541ab9baf9c04de99008a">
<p nodeId="4a676816fcf84af1aff997fb6a8eba90">决策 (decision)</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[1006]" nodeId="0de23cb994524ad69fb8f85045ad19cc">
<p nodeId="35680224584e455fbc7cc4b9d9eb142a"><span color="">命中规则后需要做的动作，每一条scene_rule_conf配置产生一个决策；针对结果的处理动作，例如：通过、拦截、冻结账号、加入黑名单等；</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="ba4ad157afb74bf8bbeb03c1b19f986b">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="1d0e41e1936741c19d0ed2efc29876c7">
<p nodeId="8946ed4701cb42c7a4f6a697a62e2ddf" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[131]" nodeId="1ed7a5ade85f4eada44830c1672f61e7">
<p nodeId="16ef8fddcdbb49d193d627ac16dc4d30">决策合并</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[1006]" nodeId="a7b3e9034cea415681d33476b12503ee">
<p nodeId="0b0ed052e6f04deda233cf9f08bf7add">Tatooine事件接入的流量，在规则执行命中的决策后，将会按照一定逻辑进行合并后再输出。</p>
<p nodeId="b279918135b64913937fd79598fb1597">目前普通场景、路由场景 自身没有决策合并能力，会统一在Tatooine进行合并。</p>
<p nodeId="3ce87064f11c4f27aa455b0f3a21fedc">分层场景本身具备<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1409924045" title="决策加工组件" nodeId="5cb809e8028e49268c9def0227cefa9c">决策加工组件</a>，对场景内的合并都会完成后再输出给Tatooine，若涉及场景间汇总才会在Tatooine进行。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="4bb2761d6ec3468f8cdbc7403d281cc2">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="010e9a326ce14cb5a8436e3e28b6ee5d">
<p nodeId="b3585039ccbd4ff580e88a57d3af7889" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[131]" nodeId="3d57709d22fb4a27bbae76448df29217">
<p nodeId="e5b99e9d9fb348a5a1d2cf3587eb682f">普通决策</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[1006]" nodeId="386b60a7b2da4d87b570fe8881befa80">
<p nodeId="3889910e72ac426c925a214839cac902">普通决策参与决策合并（分层场景-决策加工 或 Tatooine决策合并），在分层场景「补偿链路」中命中时无法输出；</p>
<p nodeId="3d4ea319716c4239af43d5476829a6c6">例如：通过、拦截、各种验证方式</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="85abe3a360fc479abd4e55426a9a66a9">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="d04cd05ebbea48a3a9d230746b9292e5">
<p nodeId="08b9577b83fb47f88116397b612cc6df" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[131]" nodeId="bb169ebfc38e437e89b31849c06d76b2">
<p nodeId="5f50d249167645fca191e44067e50b0a">异步决策</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[1006]" nodeId="35bb7e4cf7c74eaf89e36e803aaba53d">
<p nodeId="d4b6f7e376b64564a80c1cfe42f0c55e">异步决策不参与决策合并，在分层场景的实时和补偿链路，只要命中都会输出给Tatooine执行（不输出下游）。</p>
<p nodeId="4655740ec09d4553a569d2ff3602a2a1">由于其异步执行的特点，也可用作分层场景-补偿链路中，作为普通决策的「补偿决策」进行配置。配置方法见：<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1409924045" title="决策加工组件" nodeId="a385ba5f24324ca0bae18523e7b28949">决策加工组件</a></p>
<p nodeId="7954763c48a547f58047465df541d33d">例如：写kv、写名单、加入persona等</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="e0d39511eca9495c9e97e4a8796caf51">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="d42c50f39d95441c9df0dc4bd76372bd">
<p nodeId="d12542cf07a14248acdcd695b7bbfff1" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[131]" nodeId="b481a803afbb43b0b27ea863ea73833b">
<p nodeId="fd152576e88447cc81897ead1282b451">组合决策</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[1006]" nodeId="5728416c37224eb6bd7607f1924abcf6">
<p nodeId="2b5ee93ffd1441198323bc53a30e130d"><span color="#FF4A47">仅支持在分层场景中使用</span>。组合决策是一串由【且、或】逻辑拼接的普通决策ID，内部可进一步细分多个顺位。</p>
<p nodeId="8539ca3684a944f596193a36d24564c5">在3-账户安全空间中，分层场景默认的决策加工方式是输出【组合】的模式（非单个决策），因此执行上会先将组合决策拆为多个单决策，经过Yoda过滤后，再作为整体（一个优先级）参与决策合并。</p>
<p nodeId="3d12817ffb0a4dc8a604073abbfef1b0">例如：<span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)">【三方验证，支付密码验证|人脸验证,客服验证】</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="c9dbcb6831984102a1e6fc1e123a3b18">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="d3d2b42191f14352a1f4db23c9112d54">
<p nodeId="ea1ac4a9d4a248018d75cf8fbe59f0fc" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[131]" nodeId="ddc221901ee041a8ad89a807f73eadd0">
<p nodeId="e696c80446f341f68ab3b2576d6ed04a">决策优先级</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[1006]" nodeId="8a4b09379deb483ba88d89f196a2756c">
<p nodeId="07774ca6a3aa4dd1845cc55d61195c77">仅作为【分层场景】中的决策加工组件的决策合并依据，数字越小意味着优先级越高。不影响普通/路由场景中的执行。存量决策（未配置优先级）默认置为最低值9999。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="e2cacca942bc44d399e49357a64f824f">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="33d1f3d2f42e43d98666141f1e6702e9">
<p nodeId="e84ecace8b5b48a3984d069293171613" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[131]" nodeId="4ff6a0bb665e400ab316cdfa82de8206">
<p nodeId="a2345957c843428fb61cfb0d5b86bb1d">决策附加信息</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[1006]" nodeId="c3d172c91e8e4cf6af80e42b13b2fb18">
<p nodeId="3d1db494433e47d8949ce89b631cf1a6"><span color="">规则命中时，随决策一起输出的key-value型结构化数据，包含常量和动态的变量。在决策所指定的附加信息模板中填充具体的数据后就是一条附加信息，一个附加信息只属于一个决策。</span><a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/28253486" title="https://km.sankuai.com/page/28253486" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="312466fd49684244a0d2a89f0f7094e7">https://km.sankuai.com/page/28253486</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="b7de3ecfaed04beca4c2e23d09d8c000">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="694dbae6a89249418f552df106ea1b85">
<p nodeId="7989490143b14b2d80e1b1f0267dbd98" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[131]" nodeId="0f17c27646714f56b6d968a8bad8d5da">
<p nodeId="bce4ccf14b264389a514ccd8d4240f9d">决策理由</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[1006]" nodeId="9b68847b2fc14954bfeaa5870cc72acc">
<p nodeId="ee72de81a3f64bbf899f886f3ff321e8"><span color="">描述决策的具体细节，比如当决策是拦截时，其可能的原因包括拒绝快捷支付、拒绝绑卡等，决策理由指定了做出决策的具体原因。</span></p>
<p nodeId="2939dd11d0724ce9ab3b62e9620f3ec6"><span color="">一般下游业务将此字段用于C端文案透出。在场景配置策略时，决策理由和决策是分别独立的字段，没有互相依赖关系。</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h1 nodeId="8e3a4bf018614ac3a1d89736a2a22531">三、操作说明</h1>
<h2 nodeId="f5ef1c0c85834ccead008497753383ad">3.1 决策管理</h2>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="27a4a967eb4b4cd2aafa4e3f8fae5581">
<tr nodeId="9d0c1b3d5ab64e8c814925bb12d3e065">
<th colwidth="[523]" nodeId="c7d0dda46fef40e6bcccfd5f01b6bef1">
<p nodeId="edbe340c95324d5d8cab3685bd28d01c">说明</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[703]" nodeId="3f01dcb0cad747b88a11ced3259b420c">
<p nodeId="ab8f7a1c2bb94188b8a07e6aae9abb72">图例</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="8319989771c742bca0519c102e483bc5">
<td colwidth="[523]" nodeId="d0cd1e35411742348f813a66553de077">
<p nodeId="d4448354615c466d914d69d1915bada4">【决策管理】</p>
<p nodeId="274c55b2f0c547c194aaad06a9c24316">入口：菜单-策略部署-决策</p>
<p nodeId="5d7b9a4302854ec6ab8d794e6b53fe5f">搜索查询：</p>
<ul nodeId="fc36ba63d79b414da72bf618fe5dd6b0">
<li nodeId="9fa91b7a1c374399aa8de0d345b96af0">可根据多条件自由进行决策的检索。</li>
</ul>
<p nodeId="14887683661948329c2c10a528a829df">列表：</p>
<ul nodeId="e5aec38f82984e2eb02f5db1f2718805">
<li nodeId="1c816dfadf294398af7e1b83425a7b65">在列表中可获取到决策的基本信息如：ID、名称、类型、映射risklevel、优先级、有无使用附加信息、在场景中的应用情况等。</li>
<li nodeId="0913f85a6389465d9dc58d2422d1c377">点击名称，进入决策详情预览。</li>
<li nodeId="92acd5091aa84c669f97a2f01b0c722b">名称下方展示的<span color="#FF4A47">红标签</span>为场景专用，代表该决策仅能被这些场景引用。</li>
<li nodeId="14d48a8833e74197bd9a1e3bf95633b1">映射risklevel：展示决策在Tatooine对应的risklevel值，如果是组合决策，会分行来展示不同顺位的risklevel。</li>
<li nodeId="2e4bd4b6f795421db8caf06992df3d75">点击场景中的应用次数，可查看决策的引用明细</li>
</ul>
</td>
<td colwidth="[703]" nodeId="d38e8e7042b341319ecbdf8822367ee3">
