<h2 nodeId="034d74b1a76d4a38aa08452c7c22c677">3.5 内容安全加工决策</h2>
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="15cfd785915c45a9b757e42a56384afd">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="19c3602fd5174774af0cd5b0af1b03c8">仅对于<strong>35空间 </strong><strong><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">206-UGC图片疑似、205-UGC图片删除、187-UGC删除、173-UGC疑似  </span></strong><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">四个决策支持下述能力</span></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="5fcabf29e04b4cd7adeb1ff395509c92">
<tr nodeId="7c222ed238124707b31a49c8503b230f">
<th colwidth="[1104]" nodeId="7a2df8228a0e41d1814def64571a0788">
<p nodeId="a5b36e77705945aaa4a5c54adb765b84">说明</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="8df526ea91cb4e05b0143f00358b47f6">
<td colwidth="[1104]" nodeId="114c11a03413421a9b664f660b7dfa73">
<p nodeId="eb9bf9b6b9f44b98b71b8eeb98f0f482"><strong>使用方式：当决策下附加信息中某一字段key的加工方式为明细加工输出时，若命中该决策，对应的字段key将带上对应的规则风险标签输送至保时洁。</strong></p>
<p nodeId="161463623f384885a64d01ade13510f4" />
<p nodeId="8b85ad6265f94fde895d393d21765b6e"><strong>step1-了解决策中的附加信息字段含义</strong></p>
<p nodeId="6bc7538eb2584f4bbc10f71e2003f10e">决策下默认已配置好四个明细加工输出类模版key字段，分别代表保时洁所接收的图/文/动图/视频list字段</p>
<p nodeId="c0409edcca2749e9bb76788e46d79bef"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1608157813/104447469955?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="604" height="302" nodeId="f5aa4aab22f24c5eb469ee98ce28c008" /></p>
<p nodeId="d1d42ebdad9f4b56a4264bf558efcd7e" />
<p nodeId="e2cc61f91b1c4d019754279350790ba2"><strong>step2-新增附加信息</strong></p>
<p nodeId="93b8ad159cc14a67851a0ea3d9d02031"><strong>点击下方附加信息右侧「添加信息」按钮，进入附加信息添加弹窗中。</strong></p>
<ol nodeId="a886f05703154a2b84ee6c4bf65eab56">
<li nodeId="51b3cd2ed9e54abbb1f72105502d4a85">对于上述四个明细加工输出类模版key，在对应的key后方填写业务原始入参。</li>
<li nodeId="44c0955ec210437c859000efdad7cf40">填写后，若命中当前决策，则规则风险标签携带入右侧所填写的原始命中索引入参中送向对应保时洁所接收的字段。</li>
<li nodeId="a35d8422f049404cb98bac71f02417b1">
<p nodeId="5b65ac11b9f844c0b99a03055d61144e">具体命中索引会根据条件间逻辑取交并集，可能存在交集为空情况，可在弹窗末尾配置对于此类情况的兜底打标方式。</p>
<km-collapse active="false" nodeId="eb314b1e34594271b3fcfcf88d265508">
<km-title><span color="#3888FF">携带方式数据结构</span></km-title>
<km-content>
<pre language="Plain Text" isExpand="false" nodeId="72704a6bca95436cad572c5fff4613a6"><code>"contentTextList" : {0:[{ // 文字执行结果
      "ruleId": 123,     // 规则ID
      "decisionId": 188, // 决策ID
      "tagCode":[111],   // V3标签Code
      "extraInfo": {     // 附加信息，机审固定的附加信息输出字段如下
        "remarks": "",
        "DPVerifyStatus": 0,
        "DPVerifyTips": "",
        "operation": "pass",
        "HLVerifyStatus": 0,
        "HLVerifyTips": ""
      }
  }]}</code></pre>
<p nodeId="9204acefefe14ec994f9941957360238" />
</km-content>
</km-collapse>
</li>
</ol>
<p nodeId="b8ba1e006cd64f52a543e9b4c2795fe5"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1608157813/104444823051?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="290" height="147" nodeId="a956f585918b49b7bb4db655f358e8ad" /><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1608157813/104444026468?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="288" height="144" nodeId="3f2d9c60a20f40a78ae29b8072ec382f" /></p>
<p nodeId="4904be06bf024e96b77d607a6bfbf85f" />
<p nodeId="b1a4c0b71edd47a2825c152b92928b8e"><strong>step3-将附加信息配置到对应的场景配置中</strong></p>
<p nodeId="a2ce0c3f5ecc405baeab1902c9fe83d4">在识别树中选择对应的决策及附加信息，命中对应配置后即执行对应的附加信息加工<br /><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1608157813/104451970013?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="297" height="154" nodeId="963d23a18216440eaf6ac60e20bd946c" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
